ule "If someone is big then they are smart," Gary is smart (consistent with the previous step).\n   - Since Gary is big and green, by the rule "All big, green people are furry," Gary is furry.\n   - Since Gary is furry, by the rule "All furry people are white," Gary is white.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   Based on the logical deductions from the given rules, Gary is indeed white.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Gary is white" is true.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
