re the same age and Gary is quiet).\n   - All quiet, furry people are round. Since Harry is quiet and furry, Harry must be round.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**.\n   - We know that Harry is furry because he is young and young people are furry.\n   - We also know that Harry is quiet because Gary is quiet and Gary and Harry are the same age.\n   - Since Harry is quiet and furry, he must be round (as all quiet, furry people are round).\n\nGiven this analysis, we can conclude that Harry is furry. Therefore, the statement "Harry is not furry" is false.\n\nThe correct answer is:.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
