 We know that all nice, red things are round.\n   - Since we do not know if Gary is red, we cannot definitively conclude that Gary is round.\n\n6. **Conclusion:**.\n   - We know Gary is cold and nice, but we do not have enough information to determine if he is red or not.\n   - Therefore, we cannot definitively say whether Gary is round or not.\n\nGiven this analysis, the statement "Gary is round" is unknown based on the provided information.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
