 pet:\n- Students with a pet = Girls with a pet + Boys with a pet = 8 + 7 = 15\n\nThis matches the given information that 15 students have a pet.\n\n10. **Number of boys who do not have a pet:**\n    - Total boys - Boys with a pet = 12 - 7 = 5\n\n11. **Number of students who do not have a pet:**\n    - Students without a pet = Total students - Students with a pet = 30 - 15 = 15\n\nWe can verify this by checking the total number of students who do not have a pet:\n- Students without a pet = Girls without a pet + Boys without a pet = 10 + 5 = 15\n\nThis matches the given information that 10 students do not have a pet.\n\nBased on the calculations, the number of girls who do not have a pet is indeed 10.\n\nTherefore, the statement \"The number of girls who do not have a pet is 10\" is true.\n\nFinal answer: A) True\n</think>\n<answer>A) True\n</answer>",
